/diseases/methicillin-resistant-staphylococcus-aureus-(mrsa)-surveillance/  /diseases/methicillin-resistant-staphylococcus-aureus-mrsa-surveillance/  301
/diseases/escherichia-coli-enteritis,-all-reported-pathotypes/  /diseases/escherichia-coli-enteritis-all-reported-pathotypes/  301

